---
/* Direct Astro port of the supplied Landing Page Responsive / V1 export. */
---
<!-- HERO -->
<section data-screen-label="Hero" style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding:64px clamp(20px,5vw,40px) 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(320px,100%),1fr)); gap: 56px; align-items: center">
  <div style="animation:rise .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) both">
    
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(40px,5.2vw,68px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 26px;text-wrap:balance"><div><span style="font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,60.528px);">Code ships fast now.</span></div><div><span style="font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,60.528px);">Products still don't.</span></div></h1>
    <div style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; color: #514c44; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 0 34px; text-wrap: pretty"><p class="isSelectedEnd">AI made teams faster. Handoffs became the bottleneck.</p><p class="isSelectedEnd">Interfluent gives business, product, and engineering one shared understanding of the system and AI agents that can reason, coordinate, and act across it.</p><p>Instead of isolated productivity gains, Interfluent makes the whole organization compound.</p></div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center">
      <a href="#cta" style="background:#1f4e3d;color:#f6f3ec;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px">Book a walkthrough</a>
      <a href="#today" style="padding:14px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.16);color:#1e1c19">Read the story ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero illustration: two lanes -->
  <div class="rs-heroviz" style="position:relative;min-height:520px;animation:rise 1.1s .15s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) both">
    <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#efeae0 0%,#f6f3ec 100%);border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.08)"></div>
    <div style="position:relative;padding:34px 0 34px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;height:100%">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding:0 34px 14px">
        <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#514c44">CODE</span>
        <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:#1f4e3d">47 changes today</span>
      </div>
      <div style="overflow:hidden;mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000 8%,#000 92%,transparent)">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;width:max-content;animation:marquee 14s linear infinite">
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding-right:10px">
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">feat: symbol classifier v2</span>
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">fix: pdf raster memory</span>
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">chore: bump pdfjs-dist</span>
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">feat: line-type review</span>
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">refactor: graph export</span>
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">fix: dwg unit scaling</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding-right:10px">
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">feat: symbol classifier v2</span>
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">fix: pdf raster memory</span>
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">chore: bump pdfjs-dist</span>
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">feat: line-type review</span>
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">refactor: graph export</span>
            <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);white-space:nowrap">fix: dwg unit scaling</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- the gap between -->
      <div class="rs-gap" style="flex:1;position:relative;margin:26px 34px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(30,28,25,.22);border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(30,28,25,.22);min-height:190px">
        <div style="position:absolute;left:50%;top:-1px;bottom:-1px;width:1px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(31,78,61,.35) 0 6px,transparent 6px 12px)"></div>
        <div style="position:absolute;left:6%;top:18%;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(30,28,25,.06);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;animation:floaty 5s ease-in-out infinite">Which feature does this touch?</div>
        <div class="rs-bub2" style="position:absolute;right:6%;top:40%;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(30,28,25,.06);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;animation:floaty 6s .8s ease-in-out infinite">What will it cost?</div>
        <div class="rs-bub3" style="position:absolute;left:18%;bottom:14%;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(30,28,25,.06);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;animation:floaty 5.5s 1.6s ease-in-out infinite">Is the documentation still true?</div>
        <div style="position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:#e0a458;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:#1e1c19;font-size:16px">?</div>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding:0 34px 12px">
        <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#514c44">PRODUCT</span>
        <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:#c4553a">1 capability this quarter</span>
      </div>
      <div style="margin:0 34px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1)">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px"><span>Review Symbols v2</span><span style="color:#514c44;font-weight:500">waiting on estimate</span></div>
        <div style="height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#ece7dc;overflow:hidden"><div style="height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:#1f4e3d;animation:fill 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ACT 1 · TODAY -->
<section id="today" data-screen-label="Act 1 · Today" style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(60px,12vw,120px) clamp(20px,5vw,40px) clamp(40px,8vw,80px)">
  <div style="max-width:720px">
    <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#1f4e3d;margin-bottom:18px">01 · TODAY</div>
    <h2 style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 20px;text-wrap:balance">Three rooms. Three languages. One system nobody can see whole.</h2>
    <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#514c44;margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Business talks in capabilities. Product talks in requirements. Engineering talks in repositories. Every planning conversation starts by redrawing the map by hand, and the map is stale by the time the meeting ends.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- three islands -->
  <div style="position:relative;margin:64px 0 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(300px,100%),1fr));gap:28px;align-items:start">
    <div style="transform:translate(0px, 0px) rotate(-1.5deg);transition:transform .12s linear;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);border-radius:20px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(30,28,25,.07)">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#514c44">BUSINESS</span><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#1f4e3d"></span></div>
      <div style="font-size:14px;color:#514c44;margin-bottom:12px">Talks in capabilities</div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">
        <span style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#d9e6df;color:#1f4e3d;font-size:13px;font-weight:600">Improve On-boarding Time</span>
        <span style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#d9e6df;color:#1f4e3d;font-size:13px;font-weight:600">Improve Pilot Conversion Rate</span>
        
        
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:18px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(30,28,25,.16);font-size:13px;color:#c4553a;font-weight:500">How big is change in Review Symbols?</div>
    </div>

    <div style="transform:translate(0px, 0px);transition:transform .12s linear;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);border-radius:20px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(30,28,25,.07)">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#514c44">PRODUCT / BA</span><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#e0a458"></span></div>
      <div style="font-size:14px;color:#514c44;margin-bottom:12px">Talks in requirements</div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;background:#f6f3ec">
        <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px">PRD · Review Symbols v2 <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#b07a2c;background:#f6e4c6;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;margin-left:6px">DRAFT</span></div>
        <div style="height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#e4ded1;width:92%;margin-bottom:7px"></div>
        <div style="height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#e4ded1;width:78%;margin-bottom:7px"></div>
        <div style="height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#e4ded1;width:85%;margin-bottom:7px"></div>
        <div style="height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#e4ded1;width:40%"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:18px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(30,28,25,.16);font-size:13px;color:#c4553a;font-weight:500">“Which services does this actually touch?”</div>
    </div>

    <div style="transform:translate(0px, 0px) rotate(1.5deg);transition:transform .12s linear;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);border-radius:20px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(30,28,25,.07)">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#514c44">ENGINEERING</span><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#1e1c19"></span></div>
      <div style="font-size:14px;color:#514c44;margin-bottom:12px">Talks in repositories</div>
      <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#1e1c19;background:#f6f3ec;border:1px solid rgba(30,28,25,.1);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;overflow:hidden;min-width:0">
        <div style="white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis">classifier/<span style="color:#1f4e3d">SymbolClassifierService.ts</span></div>
        <div style="white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis">conversion/<span style="color:#1f4e3d">DrawingConversionService.ts</span></div>
        <div style="white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis">lines/<span style="color:#1f4e3d">LineTypeService.ts</span></div>
        <div style="color:#8a847a;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis">tests/classifier.spec.ts · 61%</div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:18px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(30,28,25,.16);font-size:13px;color:#c4553a;font-weight:500">“Which capability is this debt under?”</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- four leaks -->
  <div style="margin-top:96px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(260px,100%),1fr));gap:20px">
    
      <div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(0px);transition:opacity .1s linear,transform .1s linear;padding:26px 24px;border-top:2px solid #1f4e3d">
        <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#1f4e3d;margin-bottom:14px">01</div>
        <div style="font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.25">No shared picture of the product</div>
        <div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#514c44;text-wrap:pretty">Business talks in capabilities, engineering in repositories. Every planning conversation starts by rebuilding the map by hand.</div>
      </div>
    
      <div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(0px);transition:opacity .1s linear,transform .1s linear;padding:26px 24px;border-top:2px solid #1f4e3d">
        <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#1f4e3d;margin-bottom:14px">02</div>
        <div style="font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.25">The record goes stale on day one</div>
        <div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#514c44;text-wrap:pretty">Requirements and documentation stop matching the system, so the next change is planned against fiction.</div>
      </div>
    
      <div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(0px);transition:opacity .1s linear,transform .1s linear;padding:26px 24px;border-top:2px solid #1f4e3d">
        <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#1f4e3d;margin-bottom:14px">03</div>
        <div style="font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.25">Risk is invisible to the people who fund it</div>
        <div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#514c44;text-wrap:pretty">Debt, vulnerabilities and thin coverage are reported per file. Nobody can say which product capability is exposed.</div>
      </div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ACT 2 · SHARED CONTEXT (pinned stage) -->
<section id="context" data-screen-label="Act 2 · Shared context" style="height:280vh;position:relative">
  <div class="rs-stage" style="position:sticky;top:0;height:100vh;overflow:hidden;background:#1f4e3d;color:#f6f3ec">
    <div class="rs-pin2" style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;height:100%;padding:0 40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,420px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:48px;align-items:center">
      <div class="rs-pin2-left" style="position:relative;min-height:320px">
        <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#e0a458;margin-bottom:18px">02 · WHAT SHIPPING WELL NEEDS</div>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,46px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 28px;text-wrap:balance">One picture of the system that all three rooms can read.</h2>
        <div class="rs-pin2-copy" style="position:relative;height:150px">
          <p style="position:absolute;inset:0;margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(246,243,236,.85);opacity:1;transform:translateY(0px);text-wrap:pretty">Start with what the business actually cares about: product capabilities. Put them next to the services that implement them, instead of a slide that gets redrawn every quarter.</p>
          <p style="position:absolute;inset:0;margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(246,243,236,.85);opacity:0;transform:translateY(0px);text-wrap:pretty">Then add intent. Requirements, briefs and documentation become nodes in the same model as classes, methods and tests. A business question and a technical question now share an answer path.</p>
          <p style="position:absolute;inset:0;margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(246,243,236,.85);opacity:0;transform:translateY(0px);text-wrap:pretty">Once everything is connected, a change can be priced before a date is promised, and the record can be rewritten from the model when the system moves. The next change gets cheaper than the last.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
          <span style="height:3px;width:34px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(246,243,236,.25);position:relative;overflow:hidden"><span style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:#e0a458;transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(1)"></span></span>
          <span style="height:3px;width:34px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(246,243,236,.25);position:relative;overflow:hidden"><span style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:#e0a458;transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(0)"></span></span>
          <span style="height:3px;width:34px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(246,243,236,.25);position:relative;overflow:hidden"><span style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:#e0a458;transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(0)"></span></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- graph stage -->
      <div class="rs-pin2-graph" style="position:relative;height:min(78vh,640px);min-width:0">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible">
          
            <line x1="22" y1="26" x2="22" y2="66" pathLength="1" stroke="rgba(246,243,236,.55)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" style="stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:0;opacity:1"></line>
          
            <line x1="50" y1="22" x2="62" y2="70" pathLength="1" stroke="rgba(246,243,236,.55)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" style="stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:0;opacity:1"></line>
          
            <line x1="78" y1="28" x2="62" y2="70" pathLength="1" stroke="rgba(246,243,236,.55)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" style="stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:0;opacity:1"></line>
          
            <line x1="36" y1="42" x2="50" y2="22" pathLength="1" stroke="rgba(224,164,88,.85)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" style="stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:0;opacity:1"></line>
          
            <line x1="36" y1="42" x2="62" y2="70" pathLength="1" stroke="rgba(224,164,88,.85)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" style="stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:0;opacity:1"></line>
          
            <line x1="66" y1="42" x2="62" y2="70" pathLength="1" stroke="rgba(224,164,88,.85)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" style="stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:0;opacity:1"></line>
          
            <line x1="66" y1="42" x2="84" y2="82" pathLength="1" stroke="rgba(224,164,88,.85)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" style="stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:0;opacity:1"></line>
          
            <line x1="88" y1="40" x2="78" y2="28" pathLength="1" stroke="rgba(224,164,88,.85)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" style="stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:0;opacity:1"></line>
          
            <line x1="50" y1="22" x2="84" y2="82" pathLength="1" stroke="rgba(246,243,236,.55)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" style="stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:0;opacity:1"></line>
          
            <line x1="22" y1="26" x2="40" y2="86" pathLength="1" stroke="rgba(246,243,236,.55)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" style="stroke-dasharray:1;stroke-dashoffset:0;opacity:1"></line>
          
        </svg>
        <div style="position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:50%;height:1px;background:rgba(246,243,236,.18);opacity:1"></div>
        <div style="position:absolute;left:0;top:calc(50% - 20px);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:rgba(246,243,236,.55);opacity:1">PRODUCT · INTENT</div>
        <div style="position:absolute;left:0;top:calc(50% + 8px);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:rgba(246,243,236,.55);opacity:1">CODE · ENTITIES</div>
        
          <div style="position:absolute;left:22%;top:26%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1);opacity:1;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#d9e6df;color:#1f4e3d;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18);font-family:Figtree,sans-serif">Convert drawings</div>
        
